# 🌐 UI-Based Spring AI Application (Azure OpenAI)

## 🎯 Use Case

This demo builds a **Spring Boot web application** where users can interact with an AI model through a simple web interface.

The application:

- Accepts user input from the UI.
- Sends the request to Azure OpenAI using **Spring AI**.
- Displays the AI-generated response.
- Supports both **normal** and **streaming** responses.

