# Quick Revision

- `index.html` → Place inside `resources/static`.
- `application.properties` → Stores Azure OpenAI configuration.
- `defaultSystem()` → Applies one system prompt to every request.
- `/api/chat` → Uses `.call()` (blocking).
- `/api/stream` → Uses `.stream()` (streaming).
- `Flux<String>` → Stream of text chunks.
- `TEXT_EVENT_STREAM_VALUE` → Enables live streaming using SSE.
